<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Terrance Drew</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">born 1976</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Terrance Drew (born 1976) is a Kittitian physician and politician who has been Prime Minister of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saint-kitts">Saint Kitts</a> and Nevis since August 2022. Leader of the Saint Kitts and Nevis Labour Party, he took office after his party won the general election that month, ending the Team Unity government of Timothy Harris.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/terrance-drew.jpg" alt="Terrance Drew" width="320" height="447" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 總統府 · CC BY 2.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Terrance_Drew_20240624_Taiwan.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
